              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Vedani n’ab’i Yavani bākāba ivyawe inyuzi; ivyuma birtyorowe, n’ibimota neza vyitwa kesiya, n’imisigati, vyari mu bidandazwa vyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Dedani bar’ abadandaji bawe b’impuzu z’ igiciro kinini zo kwicarwako ku mafarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 60:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo muri Arabiya n’abaganwa bose b’i Kedari bār’ abadandaji bawe wiganziye; bākudandariza imyagazi y’intama n’ amapfizi yazo n’impene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.72.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 72:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 60:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abadandaji b’i Sheba n’i Rama bār’ abadandaji bawe; bākāba ivyawe imibavu irusha iyindi yose kwinjira, n’utubuyenge twose tw’igiciro kinini n’izahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Harani n’ab’i Kanehe n’abo muri Edeni n’abadandaji b’i Sheba no muri Ashuri n’i Kilumadi bār’ abadandaji bawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo badandaji bawe bāshōra ibintu vy’ intōrwa, imitamana y’amasufe ijererenze amabara, n’amasandugu yabājwe mu masederi arimw’ imyambaro y’igiciro kinini, atekejwe ibitsibo vy’imigozi; ivyo vyari mu bidandazwa vyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.48.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 48:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.23.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 23:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.23.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amato y’i Tarushishi yaseha ibidandazwa vyawe: nuk’ uranengesera, ugira uburemerezi uri hagati mw idamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.18.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 18:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasoza bawe bagushikanye mu mazi menshi: umuyaga uvuye i burasirazuba ugusābiriza mw idamba mu kiyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubutunzi bgawe, n’ ibishōrano vyawe, n’ibidandazwa vyawe, n’abasoza bawe, n’abagutumbereza nk’ubgato, n’abahomyi bawe b’imiguma, n’abakudandariza ibidandazwa vyawe, n’abahizi bawe bose bari muri wewe, mbere n’abanyabgato bawe bose bari hagati muri wewe, bizodobera mw idamba mu kiyaga ku musi wo kugesezwa kwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imihana izohindishwa agashitsi n’urwamo rw’akāyaga k’abatumbereza bawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LAM.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 18:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’abakoresha ingafe bose n’ abasoza n’abatumbereza ubgato bose bo mu kiyaga bazokwururuka bave mu mato yabo, bahagarare i musozi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bazorenza amajwi bakuririra, baboroge cane, biyorere imikungugu ku mitwe, bikumbagaze mu minyota: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bazokwimosha inkomvorera kubgawe, bakenyere amagunira, bakuririre batuntuye mu mitima baboroga cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu maborogo yabo bazogucurira intimba, bajoje, bati Ni hehe hahwanye n’i Tiro, hakamera nk’iki gisagara kidobejwe hagati mu kiyaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwe ibishōrano vyawe vyahora biza bivuye mu kiyaga, wahāza amahanga menshi; watungisha abami bo mw isi ibitayega vy’ubutunzi bgawe n’ivy’ ibidandazwa vyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe ikiyaga cagusāvya, ukadobera i bgina mu mazi, ibidandazwa vyawe n’abanyabgato bawe bose vyadoberanye nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababa ku kiyaga bose baragutangariye, n’abami babo bafashwe n’ubgoba bginshi, mu nyonga habo harasuherewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 26:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 18:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abadandaza bo mu mahanga bakuvuzakw agahwa; wahindutse agaterabgoba, kandi ntuzosubira kubah’ ukundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.36"
            ]
          }
        }
